            <div xml:id="m-0aa4b824-9977-4b97-be00-43ae88cfa9e0">
              <lg xml:id="m-8228c116-0f32-4454-b68f-17caecd1e53d">
                <l xml:id="m-286c8885-54e2-4aa9-89d3-498f8ff96605" facs="#m-0f817c43-5940-4ad1-9964-3b726a5bf786" label="text-like">Votive Mass of the Holy Ghost.</l><l xml:id="m-abae2252-c0cc-4b7f-8d9d-b4a1c2204858" facs="#m-ee49c54f-1520-4c42-a2a0-7933146f6aeb" label="ambiguous">1281</l><l xml:id="m-321d2bdd-a4aa-4087-b766-4352bbacb8f6" facs="#m-c84891bb-c28d-465a-a3a1-8e695c96ae51" label="ambiguous">Comm.</l><l xml:id="m-e874d5fd-c721-45eb-8e91-1b3a287c8845" facs="#m-40b753dc-211a-45a5-8dcc-6f80033bc44b" label="ambiguous">7</l><l xml:id="m-269cefe1-7160-4687-9db9-1653d1c2451a" facs="#m-5428eef6-2a00-41ff-90f2-e6d0ca42e888" label="lyrics-like">Actus est “ repénte de caélo só- nus adve-ni-én¬</l><l xml:id="m-ae63960b-2bd2-429d-9477-1d07b4e94734" facs="#m-0e06b59e-a47c-42dc-9c4e-721b3dc6f9b2" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-29c4552c-b200-43ea-af71-00507e111e64" facs="#m-8deb3b82-6244-49f1-b80b-895374efac81" label="lyrics-like">tis spí-ri-tus ve-heméntis, u-bi é-rant se-dén-tes: et</l><l xml:id="m-24f3e0d2-56fe-4263-903a-3c7b1ec32870" facs="#m-06ceb611-7f2b-495b-a427-f25885847b51" label="lyrics-like">replé-ti sunt ómnes Spí-ri-tu Sáncto,</l><l xml:id="m-8e22c93b-1c73-42b4-8605-efc1fa180fa1" facs="#m-9792a447-1720-4a31-8ff5-06cf40aa7afa" label="lyrics-like">loquén- tes ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-6bc1cf10-9eea-4c38-aef6-fe8cf7679bcd" facs="#m-71904b74-4656-42a4-908d-183e54b3ea74" label="lyrics-like">gná- li- a Dé¬ i</l><l xml:id="m-23664dc5-60bb-4e7b-981d-2d2b11a8e0d5" facs="#m-30a9ed43-ef08-4b06-ab0f-a7ccc82eab28" label="text-like">In Paschal Time, the Communion is sung as on p. 882.</l><l xml:id="m-e7937977-61cf-46e5-93c4-1dc6e22253a1" facs="#m-270718c8-e815-49cb-9c0b-8bb2dc4e04fb" label="ambiguous">Postcommanion. Sancti Spiritus, p. 883.</l><l xml:id="m-6a3a9f1c-8ac7-4e01-816a-67a9af277150" facs="#m-8235b89a-cf16-4281-94f4-079dcede0b0f" label="text-like">TTo implore the grace of the Holy Ghost, the foregoing Mass is said.</l><l xml:id="m-525ae946-196c-43b3-8ea4-25767ac7d665" facs="#m-6e72fc24-4f51-4ffd-986e-0bfae26c457a" label="text-like">but the Collect. Secret and Postcommunion are as follows:</l><l xml:id="m-8f253ff9-9e9c-45ac-94f7-a0fb15d84f4a" facs="#m-5a745e08-8b81-4452-a345-8f897e7adb18" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-a3ad47b9-119b-447a-8bec-b0468236d478" facs="#m-2b6ad84b-6f00-4632-8f32-6a83094330a6" label="lyrics-like">Eus, cui omne cor patet, et l cogitatiónes cordis nostri; ut te</l><l xml:id="m-54f598de-c645-4da0-ac5a-fe0b1b50b702" facs="#m-74dfb65d-ee04-4d71-afd0-b74489ff90c8" label="lyrics-like">I omnis volúntas lóquitur, et perfécte diligere, et digne laudáre</l><l xml:id="m-17d812d9-6105-4d9f-9aac-0d445d07ea2b" facs="#m-f6199970-e8f5-477e-8558-33336448df60" label="lyrics-like">mereámur. Per Dóminum... in uni¬</l><l xml:id="m-33a2e69e-aaab-4761-aefa-781d014b6338" facs="#m-6abf7f7d-f922-4730-9aad-7cd4a7d15609" label="lyrics-like">quem nullum latet secrétum: purí¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b77adc2-17e6-44e8-a8b7-e49315d09ac4" facs="#m-8485d2c3-9633-412f-b698-cd6b72d53f9b" label="lyrics-like">fica per infusiónem Sancti Spfritus! táte ejúsdem Spiritus.</l><l xml:id="m-2b5c8812-9fe1-46fd-bc33-51a861d85f53" facs="#m-0385de40-462b-4a42-a341-5a4499a7a2ba" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-54bb2876-72c5-4c4d-a752-e95a722014a1" facs="#m-fc5cbaf4-1535-4262-b8f6-ae1a3360bf57" label="lyrics-like">ÆC oblátio, quaésumus Dómi-] ciátur habitátio. Per Dóminum...</l><l xml:id="m-b7244ee4-54a0-4f0b-9827-a7762ff92b46" facs="#m-5e7cc876-ede7-4ba6-b57c-0b9ac8d93b3d" label="lyrics-like">in unitáte ejúsdem Spiritus</l><l xml:id="m-814e3849-6d57-4b6b-8442-0e3d87b46257" facs="#m-ec5d3102-f5b5-46d8-898c-8421fba72fe2" label="lyrics-like">It ne, cordis nostri máculas emún¬</l><l xml:id="m-9022dfb2-4797-40cf-8bd0-ae70fabdeb71" facs="#m-8c521ddc-37c8-4277-9ed0-7dde6b091e76" label="ambiguous">det: ut Sancti Spiritus digna effi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b868daa9-e87d-46da-ac06-70aa442c3459" facs="#m-75970a24-f578-47df-8e0e-2898d1141867" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-2c146dc3-3cd7-41b4-bb7c-21eeafa0fba8" facs="#m-50846fc9-7dc2-40fa-815f-2af552538a3a" label="lyrics-like">(VOncéde, quaésumus omnípotens mur tentatiónibus, et peccatórum</l><l xml:id="m-af96a96d-e03c-40df-ad12-733ec83ac3f1" facs="#m-04cff6bf-6f0e-4de1-bd4a-4e5b7c6d59da" label="ambiguous">L Deus, Sanctum nos Spiritum</l><l xml:id="m-5c728988-33b9-4e5e-95ef-354bbab0f099" facs="#m-5939b652-becf-4631-ba66-e9a5992e180c" label="lyrics-like">nostrórum indulgéntiam percipere</l><l xml:id="m-c0703cf7-5d32-4e6e-af2c-54756edf720c" facs="#m-c69912a3-6602-4200-a55a-98e640111851" label="lyrics-like">votis promeréri sédulis: quátenus! mereámur. Per Dóminum... in uni¬</l><l xml:id="m-de488fb8-6aed-4d9b-8db9-182a431f624a" facs="#m-68069751-41ce-4687-805a-2c81731fb8f2" label="lyrics-like">eius grátia, et ab ómnibus liberé-l tâte ejúsdem Spiritus Sancti Deus.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>